      "snippet": {
        "line": 468,
        "text": "def refF (δ : ℝ) : Field := fun p => if p.1 ≤ N.endpoint then N.f p else Real.exp (continuation δ N.logF (N.logTime p.1, p.2)) — this is φ_r, with endpoint = 4/Λ = X₀ and logTime X = log (X/X₀) = y"
